---
import BrandLayout from '../../layouts/BrandLayout.astro';
---
<BrandLayout locale="en" title="How the concept works — FOLIAVERE">
  <main lang="en" dir="ltr" class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Concept project</p><h2>How the concept works</h2>
    <ol><li>Define a book’s subject, audience and boundaries.</li><li>Organize authorized material into a clear outline.</li><li>Review text, design and quality before production.</li><li>Require explicit customer and founder approval before release or printing.</li></ol>
    <p class="notice">This describes a proposed process. Intake, orders and book production are not currently available.</p>
    <a href="/en/">Back to home</a>
  </main>
</BrandLayout>
<style>.page{max-width:48rem;margin:auto;padding:2rem 1rem}.page h2{font-size:2.5rem}.page li{margin-block:1rem}.notice{padding:1rem;background:var(--fv-surface);border:1px solid var(--fv-border);border-radius:var(--fv-radius-md)}</style>
